# Twitch sign-in setup (needed for: badge images, sending messages, moderation tools)
#
#   1. Go to https://dev.twitch.tv/console and register an application:
#        OAuth Redirect URL: http://localhost
#        Category:           Application Integration
#        Client Type:        Public
#   2. Copy its Client ID below.
#   3. Copy THIS file to a new file named ".env" (the real one is git-ignored) and restart `npm run dev`.
#
# The client ID is not a secret (it only identifies your app), but `.env` is still git-ignored by default.
MAIN_VITE_TWITCH_CLIENT_ID=
